# Runtime secret: DATABASE_URL=postgresql://ayure_app:...@database.example:5432/ayure
# Set via Cloudflare Worker secret at cutover; NEVER commit a real URL or password.
# DATABASE_URL_MIGRATIONS is migrator-only and MUST NOT be in application runtime.
